<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected November 1, 1996 at 12:00 Noon, C.S.T.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on November 14, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is pending through DTC.</p>
